    `A citation by address` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "item 4(c) of the First Schedule to the Criminal Procedure Law (Enforcement Powers - Body Search and Taking Identification Means), 5756-1996"
        `the citing words give the address` IS "12(1)"
        `the citing words say that provision is about` IS `the offence in paragraph (1) of section 12`
        `the provision at that address in the text as it stands is about` IS `no provision at that address`
