-- P3. Section 13(e), added by the 2026 temporary provision: "despite subsection (d), for [...] on whom an order of removal has been given, the provisions of that subsection shall apply with this change:
-- in place of "three days" read "24 hours"". The words in [...] name the class of persons in section 13(e) and are omitted on purpose; the page image shows them.
