§ `Days`

-- Published days, each from the footer of the page image: SH 1804 p.502 (7.8.2001, 18 Av 5761); KT 7386 p.1321 (19.6.2014, 21 Sivan 5774); SH 3506 p.338 (26.3.2026, 8 Nisan 5786). Each pair was computed with the same routine as in `il44-references.l4`.
