-- ext:[KT 7386 p.1321, footer, read from the page image] | קובץ התקנות 7386, כ"א בסיוון התשע"ד, 19.6.2014
-- ext:[SH 3506 p.338, footer, read from the page image] | ספר החוקים 3506, ח' בניסן התשפ"ו, 26.3.2026
`the day Sefer HaChukim 1804 was published` MEANS Date 7 8 2001
`the day Kovetz HaTakanot 7386 was published` MEANS Date 19 6 2014
`the day Sefer HaChukim 3506 was published` MEANS Date 26 3 2026

-- Amendment 9 took effect "at the end of three months from its publication" (section 11(a)); which day that is depends on how the year-and-month counting rule of the Interpretation Law applies, which this row did not read (fork F13).
-- ext:[SH 1804 p.509, section 11(a), read from the page image] | תחילתו של חוק זה בתום שלושה חודשים מיום פרסומו.
`the earliest first day of force of Amendment 9` MEANS Date 7 11 2001
`the latest first day of force of Amendment 9` MEANS Date 8 11 2001

-- Section 13(e) applies "for a period of one year from the publication" of the 2026 temporary provision (its section 1(a)); the last day is 25 or 26 March 2027 on the same counting question, unless an order under its section 1(b) extends it (no such order was looked for; fork F15).
`the earliest last day of the period of section 13(e)` MEANS Date 25 3 2027
`the latest last day of the period of section 13(e)` MEANS Date 26 3 2027
-- The day this row was written.
`the day this row was written` MEANS Date 10 11 2026
